# ProcurePilot — environment templates
#
# Copy and edit (never commit real secrets):
#   cp server/.env.example server/.env
#   cp client/.env.example client/.env
#
# Full variable lists live in those files.
# Hackathon demo minimum:
#   server/.env  → DB_*, JWT_SECRET, PAYPAL_* (sandbox), CHANNEL3_* (optional), AI_PROVIDER / Ollama
#   client/.env  → VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000, VITE_PAYPAL_* matching server sandbox client id
#
# Demo login after migrate: admin / ProcurePilot2025! (see README.md)
#
# Setup and run: see README.md
